{"name":"下拉菜单","description":"下拉菜单是点击一个入口后展开一组相关操作的浮层菜单组件 · “更多”按钮可收纳重命名、导出和删除，减少页面占用。它承载操作；从固定值中选择一个答案应使用 选择器 Select 。","quote":"鼠标放到用户名上，往下展开“设置”“退出”几个选项。","agentPrompt":"请把项目行的重命名、复制和归档收进一个 Dropdown，菜单项使用文字；归档执行前保留确认。逐一打开并执行可逆操作，确认菜单作用于当前那一行且键盘也能打开和关闭。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-dropdown\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>下拉菜单<span>Dropdown</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">鼠标放到用户名上，往下展开“设置”“退出”几个选项。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">下拉菜单是点击一个入口后展开一组相关操作的浮层菜单组件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>“更多”按钮可收纳重命名、导出和删除，减少页面占用。它承载操作；从固定值中选择一个答案应使用<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a>。</span></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>操作菜单</em><em>更多菜单</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"dd-live\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"dd-open\">\n    <label class=\"dd-mask\" for=\"dd-open\"></label>\n    <div class=\"dd-wrap\">\n      <label class=\"btn btn-outline dd-btn\" for=\"dd-open\">更多操作 <span class=\"dd-caret\">▾</span></label>\n      <div class=\"dd-anim\">\n        <div class=\"dropdown-panel dd-panel\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"ddsel\" id=\"dd-s1\">\n          <label class=\"dropdown-item dd-item\" for=\"dd-s1\">重命名</label>\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"ddsel\" id=\"dd-s2\">\n          <label class=\"dropdown-item dd-item\" for=\"dd-s2\">复制链接</label>\n          <span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span>\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"ddsel\" id=\"dd-s3\">\n          <label class=\"dropdown-item danger dd-item\" for=\"dd-s3\">删除</label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把项目行的重命名、复制和归档收进一个 Dropdown，菜单项使用文字；归档执行前保留确认。逐一打开并执行可逆操作，确认菜单作用于当前那一行且键盘也能打开和关闭。</p></blockquote></section></div><section class=\"distinctions\"><div class=\"section-title\">容易混淆？这样区分</div><div class=\"distinction-grid\"><div class=\"distinction-card\"><div class=\"distinction-head\"><span>下拉菜单<small>Dropdown</small></span><b>≠</b><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a></div><p><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/dropdown?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"dropdown\" aria-label=\"下拉菜单 Dropdown\">下拉菜单 <b>Dropdown</b></a> 展开的是操作或导航；<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a> 用来选择并保存一个表单值。</p></div></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">一个入口带<b>多个相关动作</b>：「更多 ▾」</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">更多操作 <i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">重命名</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">复制链接</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">移动到…</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">删除</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">用户头像下的<b>账户菜单</b></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;flex:none\">林</span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">个人主页</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">账号设置</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">退出登录</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把<b>低频操作收进「更多」</b>，主界面更干净</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">保存</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">更多 ▾</span></div><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:72%\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">带<b>分组、快捷键</b>的命令菜单</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt on\">保存 ⌘S</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">另存为 ⇧⌘S</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">导出 ⌘E</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只需<b>从几个值中选择一个</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">请选择城市 ▾</span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">北京</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">上海</span><span class=\"mk-opt on\">深圳</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">菜单中<b>只有一项操作</b>：直接使用按钮</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">更多 ▾</span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">删除</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把<b>核心操作</b>藏进下拉，会降低入口的可发现性</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">预览</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">更多 ▾</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">核心发布操作藏在“更多”中，难以发现</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">多层嵌套下拉菜单容易因指针偏离而关闭，应改用分组或独立页面</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">新建</span><span class=\"mk-opt on\">移动到 ▸</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">删除</span></div><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:auto;min-width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">项目 A</span><span class=\"mk-opt\">项目 B</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div class=\"dropdown-demo\">\n      <div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">更多操作 ▾</button></div>\n      <div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-panel\">\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">重命名</span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\">复制链接</span>\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sep\"><span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item danger\">删除</span>\n      </span></div>\n    </div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">触发器</span><span class=\"pe\">Trigger</span></button><span class=\"pd\">按钮或文字，点击展开菜单</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"panel\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">菜单面板</span><span class=\"pe\">Panel</span></button><span class=\"pd\">浮层，点击外部自动收起</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"item\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">菜单项</span><span class=\"pe\">MenuItem</span></button><span class=\"pd\">一个动作，可带图标和快捷键</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"sep\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">分隔线</span><span class=\"pe\">Divider</span></button><span class=\"pd\">给菜单项分组，危险操作通常单独一组</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">基础菜单<span>Basic</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">重命名</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">复制链接</span><span class=\"dropdown-item danger\">删除</span></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">一组相关操作需要共享同一个入口时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带快捷键<span>Shortcut</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">保存<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘S</span></span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">导出<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘E</span></span></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">高频操作已定义键盘快捷键时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带分组<span>Grouped</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-group\">视图</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">紧凑模式</span><span class=\"dropdown-group\">操作</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">导出</span></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">菜单包含多类操作，需要按类别分组时</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">表格行「更多操作」</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"position:relative;borde